{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05334","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 郑愔","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涌霄开宝塔，倒影驻仙舆。\n鴈子乘堂处，龙王起藏初。\n秋风圣主曲，佳气史官书。\n愿献重阳寿，承欢万岁余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}